WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.408
Day 7. Three teams, and one sound.

2
00:00:02.858 --> 00:00:09.670
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.971
Here are three teams. They all make this one sound.

4
00:00:14.684 --> 00:00:18.921
For reading they are the same. For spelling, they are learned word by word.

5
00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:23.849
The word is fern.

6
00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:28.693
The word is bird.

7
00:00:32.729 --> 00:00:33.745
The word is turn.

8
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:39.202
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

9
00:00:39.652 --> 00:00:44.175
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

10
00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:48.658
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

11
00:00:49.108 --> 00:00:52.011
Find the team. What sound does it make? Then wait.

12
00:00:52.811 --> 00:00:58.384
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

13
00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:02.297
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
